[task note by Katie Hoban on 2026-06-24 "Pension Sweep - Ben / Need LOAs"]
30/04 -&nbsp;We have received the plan information for Royal London workplace pension. Reviewed&nbsp;the possibility of a partial transfer into Transact personal pension. However, for now we recommend he keep the funds where they are. 


Having reviewed the scheme, the charges are competitive and low cost, and the fund it is currently invested in is in line with attitude to risk, so he is&nbsp;well placed where he is. Given the current value of approximately £43,000, the costs and administration involved in a partial transfer at this stage would, outweigh the benefits. As your workplace contributions continue and the fund grows in value, this is something we can revisit. Once the pension has accumulated further, a transfer is likely to make much more sense.&nbsp;
Email sent to ben and he agrred. Work closed,&nbsp;

